␀␀␀ÿÿÿÿ	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀	␀␀␀node_ids␀ ␀␀␀␀␀␀»dqˆiç(£"‹:,␀␀␀␀␀␀conn_count␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀conns␀ ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀node_paths␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀	␀␀␀id_paths␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀editable_instances␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀version␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀RSRC␀␀␀␀␀␀␀shader_type canvas_item;
render_mode unshaded;
#include "res://wholebody_palette.gdshaderinc"

uniform sampler2D part_mask : filter_nearest, repeat_disable;
uniform sampler2D helmet_texture : source_color, filter_nearest, repeat_disable;
uniform sampler2D hand_mask : filter_nearest, repeat_disable;
uniform sampler2D leg_mask : filter_nearest, repeat_disable;
uniform vec2 frame_origin;
uniform vec4 head_rect;
uniform int facing_row = 0;
uniform int equipment_mask = 0;
uniform bool leg_palette = false;
uniform bool has_leg_mask = false;
uniform bool normalize_head = false;
uniform bool clip_edges = false;
uniform vec4 head_geometry;
uniform vec2 head_target;
uniform vec2 muzzle;
varying vec4 tint;

void vertex() { tint = COLOR; }

void fragment() {
	vec2 size = vec2(textureSize(TEXTURE, 0));
	vec2 pixel = floor(UV * size - frame_origin);
	vec2 sample_pixel = pixel + vec2(.5);
	vec4 base = texture(TEXTURE, UV);
	bool luminous = base.a > .5 && (base.g > base.r * 1.4 || (base.b > base.r * 1.2 && base.r > base.g * 1.4));
	bool barrel_tip = clip_edges && distance(pixel + vec2(.5), muzzle) < 3.0;
	if (normalize_head && !luminous && !barrel_tip && abs(pixel.x - head_geometry.x) < 24.0 && pixel.y >= min(head_geometry.y, head_target.x) - 3.0 && pixel.y < max(head_geometry.z, head_target.y) + 3.0) {
		if (pixel.y < head_target.y) {
			sample_pixel.x = head_geometry.x + (sample_pixel.x - head_geometry.x) / head_geometry.w;
			sample_pixel.y = head_geometry.y + (sample_pixel.y - head_target.x) * (head_geometry.z - head_geometry.y) / (head_target.y - head_target.x);
		} else if (abs(pixel.x - head_geometry.x) < 16.0 && !(texture(hand_mask, UV).r > .5 && pixel.y >= head_geometry.z)) {
			float seam = max(head_geometry.z, head_target.y) + 3.0;
			sample_pixel.y = head_geometry.z + (sample_pixel.y - head_target.y) * (seam - head_geometry.z) / (seam - head_target.y);
		}
	}
	vec2 sample_uv = (frame_origin + sample_pixel) / size;
	base = texture(TEXTURE, sample_uv);
	vec4 parts = texture(part_mask, sample_uv);
	bool head_foreground = base.a > 0.0 && parts.r < .5;
	bool guide_red = has_leg_mask ? (base.r > .13 && base.r > base.g * 1.6 && base.r > base.b * 1.6) : (base.r > .13 && base.r > base.g * 2.0 && base.r > base.b * 2.0);
	bool guide_blue = has_leg_mask ? (base.b > .13 && base.b > base.g * 1.25 && base.b > base.r * 1.6) : (base.b > .13 && base.b > base.g * 1.6 && base.b > base.r * 1.6);
	bool pants = has_leg_mask ? texture(leg_mask,sample_uv).r > .5 : (pixel.y >= head_rect.y + head_rect.w + 10.0 && abs(pixel.x - (head_rect.x + head_rect.z * .5)) < max(12.0,head_rect.z * .65));
	if (leg_palette && pants && base.a > 0.0 && (guide_red || guide_blue)) {
		base = wholebody_cloth_palette(base, sample_pixel, 0.0, true);
		parts.gba = vec3(0.0);
	}
	float light = dot(base.rgb, vec3(.2126, .7152, .0722));
	if ((equipment_mask & 1) != 0 && parts.r > .5) base = vec4(0.0);
	else if (base.a > 0.0 && light >= .055) {
		if ((equipment_mask & 2) != 0 && parts.g > .5) {
			base.rgb = light < .13 ? vec3(.14902,.23529,.28627) : (light < .25 ? vec3(.30196,.39608,.44314) : vec3(.58039,.64706,.65490));
			if (abs(floor(sample_pixel.x) - floor(head_rect.x + head_rect.z * .5)) <= 1.0 && sample_pixel.y >= head_rect.y + head_rect.w + 3.0) base.rgb = vec3(.0902,.16863,.21569);
			else if (floor(sample_pixel.y) == head_rect.y + head_rect.w + 5.0 && abs(sample_pixel.x - (head_rect.x + head_rect.z * .5)) < 5.0) base.rgb = vec3(.28235,.6549,.70588);
		} else if ((equipment_mask & 4) != 0 && parts.b > .5) {
			base.rgb = light < .18 ? vec3(.09020,.16863,.20784) : vec3(.40392,.49412,.52549);
		} else if ((equipment_mask & 8) != 0 && parts.a > .5) {
			base.rgb = light < .16 ? vec3(.09020,.14902,.18824) : (light < .3 ? vec3(.23137,.31373,.35686) : vec3(.50980,.58824,.60392));
		}
	}
	vec2 helmet_uv = (sample_pixel - head_rect.xy) / head_rect.zw;
	if ((equipment_mask & 1) != 0 && !head_foreground && all(greaterThanEqual(helmet_uv,vec2(0.0))) && all(lessThan(helmet_uv,vec2(1.0)))) {
		vec4 helmet = texture(helmet_texture, vec2((float(facing_row) + helmet_uv.x) / 8.0, helmet_uv.y));
		base.rgb = mix(base.rgb,helmet.rgb,helmet.a);
		base.a = helmet.a + base.a * (1.0 - helmet.a);
	}
	if (clip_edges && (pixel.x < 24.0 || pixel.x >= 136.0)) base = vec4(0.0);
	COLOR = base * tint;
}
