á^rr1§[”ûh±aÎôÓnîmªíýM¤›åFÙ‚Ù’}ÆÌ¼‚µÂ×j¸Žh¼ÇüEöuÙ¦È-}ËWT6!ù­÷K¿Ë“␀ÉÅ0ûöÌ¯ìé°â¢ ÿ!ù²@,à•²ËñECâá4ùë	ŸlýŒ•âï;a0d{ôþtÑÝÂÑýÕA<î7£ë:5;øx,\¿ƒäÃËÆœ¾ÉE|¬Ž›:ÞïÂÜ=s¤‚·H#u„“8æöðäï	Þ{ÐŒzt}¾ó+lÏî
‹šS&ß™²[¿M Ú7èoÍ3¥ý5¢‹t7áKtØûkè‡ä8f[lÇ+aH<‡6šNë™åùLqöÏ¢‰À[Tâ§ôk*g{Iû\¶8×ó;ù¥k‡¥EéôßAø|íRyÙý˜.ÊƒØâ©dýž¶7ÒÏ.ÿc¼yí0+\ô†Ü\~W›GÎ~:KTl‹+ª—l¶hZÐ¨A¿êÿIGuµ9Ó»Æû¬ûÿrÜ(Šì¡¿[_ßÑÜ¹ïGÇóú^ðå‡?¾6wncÝ¢õÛ’pýFÝùØýÆüßÝ½½_ìPÉ:Åaµ¹òN	f{b^98¿Äg>ÛÒrcz:·ÒÔ„ÃµnÂqCMN‹Kª#”í»ÈäˆSw“uêÎ¼ÿè^GIž=ÏÇÔß_šð·{¤Ûj9~␀shader_type canvas_item;
render_mode unshaded;
uniform int weapon_kind = 0;
uniform bool ground = false;
uniform bool authored = false;
uniform vec2 atlas_grid = vec2(8.0,4.0);
uniform float first_frame = 24.0;
uniform float last_frame = 7.0;
varying vec4 tint;
void vertex() { tint = COLOR; }
void fragment() {
    vec2 grid = ground ? vec2(3.0,2.0) : atlas_grid;
    vec2 cell = floor(UV*grid);
    float frame = cell.x+cell.y*grid.x-(ground ? 0.0 : first_frame);
    float time = clamp(frame/(ground ? 5.0 : last_frame),0.0,1.0);
    vec2 q = ((floor(fract(UV*grid)*96.0)+.5)/96.0-.5)*2.0;
    if (authored) {
        COLOR = texture(TEXTURE,UV)*tint;
        float light = max(max(COLOR.r,COLOR.g),COLOR.b);
        vec3 accent = weapon_kind == 1 ? vec3(.60,.35,1.0) : vec3(.12,.82,1.0);
        COLOR.rgb = mix(accent*.65,vec3(.91,.99,1.0),smoothstep(.30,.92,light));
        if (ground) COLOR.a *= step(length(q),1.0);
    } else if (weapon_kind >= 3 && weapon_kind <= 9 && !ground) {
        bool heavy = weapon_kind >= 8;
        bool scatter = weapon_kind == 5;
        bool needle = weapon_kind == 4 || weapon_kind == 7;
        vec3 color = heavy || scatter ? vec3(.65,.36,1.0) : vec3(.12,.81,1.0);
        float fade = pow(1.0-time,2.0);
        float flash = pow(1.0-time,4.0);
        float r = length(q);
        float width = needle ? .023 : (scatter ? .074 : .045);
        float length_mask = (1.0-smoothstep(.62,.96,abs(q.x)));
        float core = (1.0-smoothstep(width*.45,width,abs(q.y)))*length_mask*fade;
        float body = (1.0-smoothstep(width,width*2.0,abs(q.y)))*length_mask*fade*.48;
        float cut = abs(q.y-q.x*(weapon_kind == 7 ? .60 : -.90));
        core = max(core,(1.0-smoothstep(.018,.045,cut))*(1.0-smoothstep(.18,.55,r))*flash);
        float diamond = abs(q.x)*.60+abs(q.y);
        core = max(core,(1.0-smoothstep(.08,.21,diamond))*flash);
        if (heavy) {
            float ring = mix(.26,.95,sqrt(time));
            core = max(core,(1.0-smoothstep(.016,.043,abs(r-ring)))*pow(1.0-time,1.5));
            body = max(body,(1.0-smoothstep(.045,.10,abs(r-ring)))*fade*.60);
            core = max(core,(1.0-smoothstep(.10,.36,r))*flash);
        }
        for (int i=0; i<7; i++) {
            float a = heavy ? float(i)*2.399 : (float(i)-3.0)*(scatter ? .40 : .26);
            vec2 axis = vec2(cos(a),sin(a));
            vec2 shard = q-axis*(.18+time*(.52+float(i%2)*.16));
            float along = dot(shard,axis);
            float across = abs(dot(shard,vec2(-axis.y,axis.x)));
            float span = (scatter || heavy ? .16 : .12)*(1.0-time)+.012;
            float taper = max(0.0,1.0-abs(along)/span);
            float spark = step(abs(along),span)*step(across,(heavy ? .038 : .026)*taper)*fade;
            core = max(core,spark);
        }
        COLOR = vec4(mix(color,vec3(1.0,.99,.91),smoothstep(.25,.82,core)),max(core,body))*tint;
    } else {
    vec3 color = weapon_kind == 0 ? vec3(.08,.77,.89) : (weapon_kind == 1 ? vec3(.56,.38,.90) : vec3(.95,.43,.28));
    if (weapon_kind == 3 || weapon_kind == 6 || weapon_kind == 7) color = vec3(.16,.82,1.0);
    if (weapon_kind == 4 || weapon_kind == 5 || weapon_kind == 10) color = vec3(1.0,.72,.28);
    if (weapon_kind == 8 || weapon_kind == 9) color = vec3(.69,.42,1.0);
    float core = 0.0;
    float body = 0.0;
    if (ground) {
        float r = length(q);
        float ring = mix(.30,.98,sqrt(time));
        core = (1.0-smoothstep(.012,.037,abs(r-ring)))*(1.0-time);
        body = (1.0-smoothstep(.04,.17,abs(r-ring)))*(1.0-time)*.5;
        body = max(body,step(r,.87)*.10*(1.0-time));
        for (int i=0; i<9; i++) {
            float a = float(i)*2.399+.2;
            vec2 axis = vec2(cos(a),sin(a));
            float along = dot(q,axis);
            float across = dot(q,vec2(-axis.y,axis.x));
            float fracture = across-.035*sin(floor(along*16.0)+float(i)*3.0);
            float crack = step(.12,along)*step(along,.86)*step(abs(fracture),.014)*(1.0-time);
            core = max(core,crack*.75);
            float chip = step(abs(along-(.38+time*.52)),.035)*step(abs(across),.018)*(1.0-time);
            core = max(core,chip);
        }
        core *= step(r,1.0); body *= step(r,1.0);
    } else {
        vec2 axis = weapon_kind == 6 || weapon_kind == 7 ? vec2(1.0,0.0) : normalize(vec2(.8,.6));
        float along = dot(q,axis);
        float across = dot(q,vec2(-axis.y,axis.x));
        if (weapon_kind == 1) across += sin(floor(along*14.0)*2.4)*.045;
        float length_mask = 1.0-smoothstep(.62,.83,abs(along));
        float fade = pow(1.0-time,1.7);
        float thickness = weapon_kind == 7 ? .55 : (weapon_kind == 5 || weapon_kind == 2 ? 1.6 : 1.0);
        core = (1.0-smoothstep(.018,.040,abs(across)/thickness))*length_mask*fade;
        body = (1.0-smoothstep(.045,.11,abs(across)/thickness))*length_mask*fade*.55;
        float r = length(q);
        float angle = atan(q.y,q.x);
        float points = weapon_kind == 1 || weapon_kind == 4 || weapon_kind == 5 ? 3.0 : (weapon_kind == 10 ? 2.0 : 4.0);
        float rays = pow(abs(cos(angle*points)),14.0);
        float ray_length = weapon_kind == 4 ? .42 : (weapon_kind == 5 || weapon_kind == 2 ? .74 : .60);
        float burst = (1.0-smoothstep(.08,.14+rays*ray_length,r))*pow(1.0-time,3.0);
        core = max(core,burst);
        body = max(body,burst*.65);
        if (weapon_kind == 8 || weapon_kind == 9) {
            float wave = mix(.25,.92,sqrt(time));
            body = max(body,(1.0-smoothstep(.018,.065,abs(r-wave)))*(1.0-time)*.7);
        }
        for (int i=0; i<7; i++) {
            float a = float(i)*2.4+float(weapon_kind)*.7;
            vec2 axis2 = vec2(cos(a),sin(a));
            vec2 chip = q-axis2*(.18+time*(.50+float(i%2)*.17));
            float x = abs(dot(chip,axis2));
            float y = abs(dot(chip,vec2(-axis2.y,axis2.x)));
            float spark = step(x,.055*(1.0-time)+.012)*step(y,.012)*(1.0-time);
            core = max(core,spark*.8);
        }
    }
    COLOR = vec4(mix(color*.72,vec3(1.0,.99,.91),core),max(core,body))*tint;
    }
}
